    "text": "Somers Point\nSomers Point Cracks Down on E-Bikes After Fatal Crash\nBy Joe Kelly,\n5 hours agoLess than ten days after a fatal crash involving an E-Bike (Electric Bicycle) and a car near the bike path in Somers Point, Somers Point Police are upping their enforcement of E-Bike regulations in the city. The move follows other Atlantic County communities that have also cracked down on E-Bikes.",
